    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<b>Custom path</b>\nBy default all text files in the working directory
    will be added to the dropdown list. Using the option below you can add a text
    file located somewhere else.\n\nEnter a path including .txt extension to a text
    file containing word data formatted either as:\n<b>Kanji characters</b> [space]
    <b>Hiragana characters</b> [space] <b>Translation</b> \nor \n<b>Kanji characters</b>
    [space] <b>Hiragana characters</b> \n\nFor example:\n\u4EBA \u3072\u3068 Person\r\n\u5C71
    \u3084\u307E Mountain\r\n\u884C\u304F \u3044\u304F To go\n\nYou can get the path
    of a file by holding shift, right clicking the file and selecting \"Copy As Path\""
